# Docker Sandbox Workshop

2-hour core session + **10 self-paced labs** on [Docker Sandboxes](https://docs.docker.com/ai/sandboxes/).

## Structure

- `lab-01-first-sandbox/` — install, run, inspect, teardown
- `lab-02-network-policy/` — network policy, custom template, clone preview
- `lab-03-secrets/` — credential injection, sentinel values
- `lab-04-clone-workflow/` — `--clone`, test branch, `git fetch sandbox-<name>`
- `lab-05-workshop-app/` — template + kit for workshop-app
- `lab-06-customize-stack/` — templates + kits + skills from `customize/`
- `lab-07-build-component/` — agent adds UI component in clone mode
- `lab-08-create-kit/` — build & validate custom kit (`starter-kit/`)
- `lab-09-use-custom-kit/` — run with `./my-workshop-kit`
- `lab-10-capstone/` — `gh` secret + clone + PR
- `workshop-app/` — Next.js demo — sbx workspace for labs 4–10
- `docker-sandbox-platform/` — hosted register / login / progress — https://nextjs-26f1-3000.prg1.zerops.app
- `workshop-landing/` — Zerops conference site
- `workshop-app/` — conference landing (Zerops)
- `customize/` — templates (`templates/`) and kit mixin (`kit/`)

## Key concepts

- **`sbx run claude .`** / **`sbx run cursor .`** — boot microVM, sync workspace, start agent
- **`sbx run --clone`** — private Git clone; fetch `sandbox-<name>` on host ([workflows](https://docs.docker.com/ai/sandboxes/workflows/))
- **`sbx ls`** — list sandboxes — no `sbx status`
- **Templates** — `docker build` → `docker image save` → `sbx template load` (no shell scripts)
- **Kits** — `--kit ./path` at create; `sbx kit validate` / `sbx kit add`
- **Secrets** — `sbx secret set -g anthropic`; VM sees `proxy-managed`

## When editing lab content

Keep commands copy-pasteable in README markdown only. No lab driver shell scripts. Validate against https://docs.docker.com/ai/sandboxes/ and `sbx --help`.
